{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a modern, premium **“Our Story” Shopify section** for the TOOSA website, compatible with the **Refine Shopify theme**.
    
    Use the current design direction as inspiration, but improve the visual hierarchy, spacing, typography, and overall premium UI.
    
    ### Layout
    
    * Desktop: two-column layout with approximately 50/50 width.
    * Image on the left and content on the right.
    * Use a slightly asymmetric layout for a more premium look.
    * Keep the section centered within the Refine theme's container width.
    * Use generous whitespace between image and content.
    * Mobile: stack the image first, followed by the content.
    
    ### Image
    
    * Add a customizable image picker.
    * Use a large high-quality professional TOOSA image.
    * Rounded corners with configurable border radius.
    * Use `object-fit: cover`.
    * Add optional subtle image hover/zoom effect.
    * Allow the merchant to control image position/crop.
    * Optional small decorative brand badge or label over the image.
    * Lazy-load the image for performance.
    
    ### Content
    
    Create customizable settings for:
    
    * Small eyebrow text, e.g. `OUR STORY`
    * Main heading: `Our Story`
    * Rich text description
    * Optional highlighted/bold text within the description
    * CTA button, e.g. `About Us`
    * CTA link
    * Optional secondary text/link
    
    The heading should have strong visual hierarchy and use the existing Refine theme typography where possible.
    
    ### Premium UI
    
    Improve the current basic layout with:
    
    * Clean editorial-style typography.
    * Strong heading hierarchy.
    * Comfortable paragraph line-height.
    * Subtle orange TOOSA accent color for the CTA and optional eyebrow.
    * Optional thin decorative line above the heading.
    * Soft section background option such as white, light gray, or custom color.
    * Optional subtle image shadow.
    * Avoid excessive animations or decorative elements.
    * Keep the design professional and consistent with TOOSA's industrial/product branding.
    
    ### Customization Settings
    
    Add Shopify Theme Editor settings for:
    
    * Image
    * Image position
    * Image width
    * Image height
    * Image border radius
    * Image aspect ratio
    * Image overlay/badge enable/disable
    * Eyebrow text
    * Heading
    * Description
    * Button text
    * Button link
    * Button style
    * Text alignment
    * Desktop column spacing
    * Section maximum width
    * Top/bottom padding
    * Mobile padding
    * Background color
    * Text color
    * Accent color
    * Image shadow enable/disable
    * Animation enable/disable
    
    ### Responsive Design
    
    Desktop:
    
    * Two-column layout.
    * Image vertically aligned with content.
    * Large but controlled image height.
    * Comfortable content width for readability.
    
    Tablet:
    
    * Maintain two columns where space allows.
    * Reduce image height, typography and spacing automatically.
    
    Mobile:
    
    * Image appears first.
    * Content appears below the image.
    * Heading uses responsive font sizing.
    * Text remains easy to read.
    * CTA becomes full-width or appropriately sized.
    * No horizontal overflow.
    * Maintain clean spacing between image, heading, text and button.
    
    ### Technical Requirements
    
    * Shopify OS 2.0 section.
    * Fully compatible with the Refine theme.
    * Use Liquid, CSS and vanilla JavaScript only.
    * No external libraries.
    * Use Shopify theme settings instead of hard-coded values wherever possible.
    * Use existing Refine theme typography and button styles where possible.
    * Use semantic HTML and accessible button/link markup.
    * Lazy-load the main image.
    * Keep CSS scoped to the section so it does not affect other Shopify sections.
    * Ensure the section works correctly when added multiple times to the same page.
    
    ### Desired Visual Result
    
    The final section should feel like a **premium brand story/editorial section**, not a basic image-and-text block.
    
    Recommended visual flow:
    
    [ Large Professional TOOSA Image ]    OUR STORY
    Our Story
    ─────────
    Short compelling
    brand story with
    strong typography.
    
    ```
                                      [ About Us → ]
    ```
    
    The final design should look polished, spacious, modern and consistent with the TOOSA Refine Shopify storefront.
    , button colors are not working 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-our-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-our-story-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: 20px;
    padding-right: 20px;
  }

  .ai-our-story-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.column_gap }}px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-our-story-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    {% if block.settings.enable_image_shadow %}
      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-our-story-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_height }}px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: {{ block.settings.image_position }};
    display: block;
    {% if block.settings.enable_image_hover %}
      transition: transform 0.6s ease;
    {% endif %}
  }

  {% if block.settings.enable_image_hover %}
    .ai-our-story-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-our-story-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-our-story-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_height }}px;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-our-story-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    max-height: 300px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-our-story-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 30px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 12px 24px;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .ai-our-story-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding-left: {{ block.settings.content_padding }}px;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-our-story-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    display: block;
  }

  {% if block.settings.show_decorative_line %}
    .ai-our-story-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after {
      content: '';
      display: block;
      width: 40px;
      height: 2px;
      background-color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
      margin-top: 12px;
      {% if block.settings.text_alignment == 'center' %}
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
      {% elsif block.settings.text_alignment == 'right' %}
        margin-left: auto;
      {% endif %}
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-our-story-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.heading_font.style }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
  }

  .ai-our-story-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.text_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .ai-our-story-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} p {
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .ai-our-story-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ai-our-story-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  .ai-our-story-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    {% if block.settings.text_alignment == 'center' %}
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    {% elsif block.settings.text_alignment == 'right' %}
      justify-content: flex-end;
    {% else %}
      justify-content: flex-start;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-our-story-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 12px 22px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    border-style: solid;
    border-width: {{ block.settings.button_border_width }}px;
  }

  .ai-our-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-our-story-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }} !important;
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }} !important;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }} !important;
  }

  .ai-our-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-our-story-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }} !important;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }} !important;
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }} !important;
  }

  .ai-our-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-our-story-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: transparent !important;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }} !important;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.text_color }} !important;
  }

  .ai-our-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-our-story-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.text_color }} !important;
    color: {{ block.settings.section_background }} !important;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.text_color }} !important;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-our-story-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .ai-our-story-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: 0;
      text-align: {{ block.settings.mobile_text_alignment }};
    }

    .ai-our-story-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.heading_size }}px * 0.75);
    }

    .ai-our-story-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.text_size }}px * 0.9);
    }

    .ai-our-story-image-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-our-story-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_height }}px;
    }

    .ai-our-story-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.mobile_text_alignment == 'center' %}
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
      {% elsif block.settings.mobile_text_alignment == 'right' %}
        justify-content: flex-end;
      {% else %}
        justify-content: flex-start;
      {% endif %}
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .ai-our-story-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% comment %} width: 100%; {% endcomment %}
      max-width: 300px;
    }

    {% if block.settings.show_decorative_line %}
      .ai-our-story-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after {
        {% if block.settings.mobile_text_alignment == 'center' %}
          margin-left: auto;
          margin-right: auto;
        {% elsif block.settings.mobile_text_alignment == 'right' %}
          margin-left: auto;
          margin-right: 0;
        {% else %}
          margin-left: 0;
          margin-right: auto;
        {% endif %}
      }
    {% endif %}
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-our-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: {{ block.settings.mobile_padding_top }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_padding_bottom }}px;
    }

    .ai-our-story-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: 16px;
      padding-right: 16px;
    }
    .ai-our-story-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<our-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-our-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-our-story-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-our-story-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-our-story-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.image %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.image.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.image.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.image.height }}"
            class="ai-our-story-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-our-story-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            <div class="ai-our-story-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              Add your story image
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-our-story-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.eyebrow_text != blank %}
          <span class="ai-our-story-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.eyebrow_text }}</span>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-our-story-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
          <div class="ai-our-story-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.description }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        <div class="ai-our-story-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.button_text != blank %}
            <a
              href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}"
              class="ai-our-story-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-our-story-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
              {{ block.settings.button_text }}
            </a>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.secondary_button_text != blank %}
            <a
              href="{{ block.settings.secondary_button_link }}"
              class="ai-our-story-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-our-story-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
              {{ block.settings.secondary_button_text }}
            </a>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</our-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class OurStory{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.initImageHover();
      }

      initImageHover() {
        const imageWrapper = this.querySelector('.ai-our-story-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        if (!imageWrapper) return;

        imageWrapper.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {
          imageWrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('our-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}', OurStory{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

